5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us look for a project that truly grows. I believe understanding our past is the key to a fruitful future.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I just... I want to make sure we can actually afford whatever we pick. I'm worried about the budget.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited! I want to find out why things sometimes go wrong. It's like a puzzle! Let's find the missing pieces!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We should focus on the actual operational losses. I want to see the data on where time and resources are being wasted on the floor.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We must be realistic about our human resources. I will investigate the actual capacity of our staff to ensure we aren't overextending them.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, your caution is a virtue. However, remember that the most expensive mistake is repeating one we have already made.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I guess you're right. I just don't want us to have a surprise bill next year.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, do you think the people are just tired, or is it because the plan was silly? I bet it's a mystery!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, it is rarely a mystery. It is usually a systemic failure. We need to look at the incident logs and the time lost.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, I agree. Systemic failure often manifests as an invisible burden on the staff. We cannot ignore the human cost of ""efficiency.""","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from reflection. I shall look into the outcomes of previous rollouts and our standardization efforts to see if we are learning.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I'll look into the capital budget and the vendor pricing. I just want to be sure.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to check the network coverage at customer plants and the in-house developer availability! I want to know if we can even get inside!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records. These are the real costs.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the staffing of the coordination group and the in-house developer availability. We need to know who is actually doing the work.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
